Description: CVE-2026-56003: bound computeProps writes to the property buffer
 ComputeScaledProperties allocates a fixed property buffer of 70 slots.
 computeProps writes one slot for an unscaled property and two slots for
 a scaledX or scaledY property, with no check against that capacity.
 PCF properties are not deduplicated, so repeated names that match
 fontPropTable overflow the buffer.
 .
 Pass the remaining capacity into computeProps and skip a property that
 would not fit. Scaled properties are written inside the switch so every
 store is covered by that check.
 .
 CVE-2026-56003 / ZDI-CAN-30560
Origin: upstream, https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libxfont/-/commit/dff957a5158da038a282a59a31fe736702732939
